        <p><seg type="caption" source="#source-117738-117838"><seg source="#source-117765-117771">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-117771-117802"><seg source="#source-117771-117773">24</seg></hi></seg></p>
