        <p><seg type="caption" source="#source-928754-928856"><seg source="#source-928781-928787">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-928787-928820"><seg source="#source-928787-928790">376</seg></hi></seg></p>
