        <p><figure source="#source-1494195-1494327"><graphic url="fig55990_699.png" width="407px" height="200px"/><note type="caption-reference"><seg source="#source-1494204-1494210">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-1494210-1494243"><seg source="#source-1494210-1494213">699</seg></hi></note></figure></p>
