        <p><seg type="caption" source="#source-1577435-1577537"><seg source="#source-1577462-1577468">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-1577468-1577501"><seg source="#source-1577468-1577471">733</seg></hi></seg></p>
