        <p><seg type="caption" source="#source-1577675-1577777"><seg source="#source-1577702-1577708">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-1577708-1577741"><seg source="#source-1577708-1577711">734</seg></hi></seg></p>
