        <p><seg type="caption" source="#source-1578155-1578257"><seg source="#source-1578182-1578188">図‐</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-1578188-1578221"><seg source="#source-1578188-1578191">736</seg></hi></seg></p>
